        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(D) Initial Advance of Equity and all subsequent advances are made without interest and must be repaid: 1) immediately but no more than seven (7) calendar days following receipt of the net proceeds from the sale of the Employee's home, or 2) six (6) months from the date of the initial promissory note, or 3) on demand, in the event employment is terminated for any reason, or 4) if there is default or inappropriate use of funds, whichever occurs first. Partial payments received by an Employee from a buyer within the six (6) month period shall be remitted immediately to the Company.",
            "block_bbox": [
