        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(e) An Employee who is notified of a Permanent Transfer, accepts the transfer, disposes of a home which qualifies under Paragraph 5(d)(1)(i), may elect to receive, in lieu of any monies or services to which otherwise eligible under Paragraphs 5(c), 5(d) and their subparagraphs, a lump sum payment of $21,000, less applicable taxes, provided the Employee:",
            "block_bbox": [
                343,
